This README file has been added to the standard zlib directory package by Joe Mandeville.
To make zlib libraries for use with "jip" tools, follow these instructions.

From this directory:

make distclean
./configure
make

To verify that the library is new, "ls -l libz.a"

MAKE A DIRECTORY FOR THIS OS/MACHINE IF ONE DOES NOT EXIST: "OS-machine"

unix% uname -s
Linux
unix% uname -i
i686
unix% mkdir Linux-i686

THEN

unix% mv libz.a Linux-i686
